### get a tournament 5
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/tournaments/1 HTTP/1.1

### close registration for tournament 5 and generate 1rst round
PUT  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/tournaments/1/closeRegistration HTTP/1.1

### get a tournament 5
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/rounds/1?relations=players HTTP/1.1

### get a games 18
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/games/1?relations=players HTTP/1.1


### update game 1
POST https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/gameHistory HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score1": 10,
  "player1": 2,
  "score2": 0,
  "player2": 1,
  "game": {"id":1,"state":"terminee"}
}
### update game 24
POST https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/gameHistory HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score1": 10,
  "player1": 3,
  "score2": 5,
  "player2": 4,
  "game": {"id":2, "state":"terminee"}
}
### generate next round
PUT  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/tournaments/1/generateNextRound HTTP/1.1



### update game 3
POST https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/gameHistory HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score1": 10,
  "player1": 3,
  "score2": 5,
  "player2": 1,
  "game": {"id":3 , "state":"terminee"}
}
### generate next round
PUT  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/tournaments/1/generateNextRound HTTP/1.1

